{"version":"1","id":"codeascraft","handle":"codeascraft","name":"Code as Craft","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/75813888013a4e0f928faa87394c4b96","description":null,"is_squad":false,"x":2.3089,"y":-1.3375,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":49,"newest_post_at":"2025-01-27T22:00:36.220Z","oldest_post_at":"2022-09-06T11:53:28.121Z","features":{"hype_score":0.0,"listicle_ratio":0.0,"question_ratio":0.020408,"avg_read_time":6.897959,"summary_length_avg":333.040816,"title_length_avg":50.836735,"title_length_var":210.748855,"tag_entropy":3.792067,"tag_diversity":1.183673,"top_tag_share":0.142857,"avg_upvotes":0.326531,"median_upvotes":0.0,"avg_comments":0.0,"comment_to_upvote_ratio":0.058824,"zero_engagement_share":0.77551,"viral_share":0.0,"posts_per_week":0.392259,"non_article_ratio":0.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"recency_skew":0.020833},"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[-6.8971,-9.3382],"cadence_depth":[-4.5441,2.0882],"hype_variety":[-8.9118,6.0],"title_style":[1.0441,-8.2647]},"top_tags":[["machine-learning",11],["ux",5],["database",5],["testing",5],["deep-learning",4],["kubernetes",4],["ab-testing",4],["android",3]],"sample_titles":{"representative":["Etsy\u2019s Journey to TypeScript","Opinion: When should a software engineer switch into management?","Using Real-Time Streaming to Power Etsy's Offsite Ads"],"outlier":["From Image Classification to Multitask Modeling: Building Etsy\u2019s Search by Image Feature"]},"recent_posts":[{"id":"l6oQGYet7","title":"Adopting Jetpack Compose for Etsy's Android App","url":"https://www.etsy.com/codeascraft/adopting-jetpack-compose-for-etsy39s-android-app","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/adopting-jetpack-compose-for-etsy-s-android-app-l6oqgyet7","summary":"Etsy adopted Jetpack Compose for their Android app, gradually transitioning to this tool for UI development. This involved creating curriculum, conducting training sessions, and validating performance through internal testing. Major UI components were rebuilt using Compose, resulting in better performance, developer satisfaction, and improved user interaction. Key benefits noted include simplified layout manipulation, powerful previews, and easier testing. Despite initial challenges, Compose has become the standard for Etsy's Android UI development.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/15eb9d731ae237b7a11a5886c8b967b7?_a=AQAEuj9","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-01-27T22:00:36.220Z"},{"id":"89iTE1b6h","title":"Machine Learning in Content Moderation at Etsy","url":"https://www.etsy.com/codeascraft/machine-learning-in-content-moderation-at-etsy","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/machine-learning-in-content-moderation-at-etsy-89ite1b6h","summary":"Etsy leverages machine learning for content moderation to maintain a safe marketplace, using supervised learning to identify and remove policy violations. They rely heavily on community reporting and automated controls, processing multimodal signals from listings. Their model architecture includes BERT-based text encoders and EfficientNet image encoders, evaluating performance through A/B testing and frequent retraining. Etsy's system has successfully identified and removed over 100,000 violations, contributing to the safety and trustworthiness of their platform.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/b1df4a5f38476ec1f2cf54e4002bad7b?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-08-06T11:15:03.000Z"},{"id":"n2Q4ZYDB0","title":"Enhancing Cloud Usage Forecasting, Monitoring & Optimizing","url":"https://www.etsy.com/codeascraft/enhancing-cloud-usage-forecasting-monitoring--optimizing","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/enhancing-cloud-usage-forecasting-monitoring-optimizing-n2q4zydb0","summary":"Etsy's FinOps team maximizes cloud value, uses a reliable forecasting methodology, monitors costs with internal tools, and mitigates cost increases. They also focus on cost optimization initiatives.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/7cf63e27c6412dbfa3be203b816ba67f?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-06-17T13:58:16.000Z"},{"id":"Pw1VpGuD1","title":"Efficient Visual Representation Learning And Evaluation","url":"https://www.etsy.com/codeascraft/efficient-visual-representation-learning-and-evaluation","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/efficient-visual-representation-learning-and-evaluation-pw1vpgud1","summary":"Etsy has developed applications like visual search and visually similar recommendations, powered by machine learning models that encode images as vector representations. EfficientNet models and EfficientFormer-l3 are used for visual representation learning. Fine-tuning and multitask learning are employed to further optimize performance. Evaluation of visual representations is done through nearest neighbor retrieval tasks and generative AI. Efficient inference and downstream tasks are also discussed, highlighting the positive impact of efficient visual representations across various applications at Etsy.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/54f4fd38a4b4b1eb5e54221b6a0aa7de?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-06-07T17:23:02.000Z"},{"id":"NhD5I1umI","title":"Macram\u00e9: Untangling the Knot on the Etsy Android Listing Screen","url":"https://www.etsy.com/codeascraft/macrame-untangling-the-knot-on-the-android-listing-screen","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/macram-untangling-the-knot-on-the-etsy-android-listing-screen-nhd5i1umi","summary":"The Etsy Android app's listing screen, which showcases items for sale, underwent a rewrite using an architecture called Macram\u00e9. This new architecture improved performance, increased test coverage, and led to positive business metrics. The team plans to expand the use of Macram\u00e9 to other screens in the app.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/93d9df865e2977a1d0daa6fe9c572769?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-18T16:19:15.000Z"},{"id":"xU7W2gLv4","title":"How We Built The Deals Tab in Swift UI","url":"https://www.etsy.com/codeascraft/how-we-built-the-deals-tab-in-swift-ui","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-we-built-the-deals-tab-in-swift-ui-xu7w2glv4","summary":"Etsy's App Updates team revamped the Updates tab into the Deals tab, a hub for a buyer's deals. They used Swift UI and Tuist frameworks to build the tab and faced challenges with UIKit interoperability and listing cards. Despite the initial hurdles, they exceeded product expectations and met deadlines.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/d2287296c47c5a39a4ef32311fb32825?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-05T22:22:54.000Z"},{"id":"hqDN90jc7","title":"Behind the Scenes - A Glimpse to Tax Calculations","url":"https://www.etsy.com/codeascraft/behind-the-scenes---a-glimpse-to-tax-calculations","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/behind-the-scenes---a-glimpse-to-tax-calculations-hqdn90jc7","summary":"This post provides a glimpse into the tax calculation infrastructure on Etsy, including the tax determination workflow, partnership with Vertex, tax reporting and audit purposes, mapping of product categories to tax categories, and handling increased API traffic.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4cf2b78c38ab92a02e0daeb16a2de9e8?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-03T16:12:58.000Z"},{"id":"KWUaKKiH8","title":"The AR Measuring Box: Etsy's answer to Big Tape Measure","url":"https://www.etsy.com/codeascraft/the-ar-measuring-box-etsys-answer-to-big-tape-measure?utm_source=OpenGraph&utm_medium=PageTools&utm_campaign=Share","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-ar-measuring-box-etsy-s-answer-to-big-tape-measure-kwuakkih8","summary":"Etsy introduced a new feature in its iOS app that could place Etsy sellers' artwork on a user's wall using Apple's Augmented Reality (AR) tools. It let them visualize how a piece would look in their space, and even gave them an idea of its size options.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/21b9246242711d9a0d3f08e6365f0b81?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-09-18T20:11:58.000Z"},{"id":"hZnM5NXiF","title":"The So-fine Real-time ML Paradigm","url":"https://www.etsy.com/codeascraft/the-so-fine-real-time-ml-paradigm?utm_source=OpenGraph&utm_medium=PageTools&utm_campaign=Share","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-so-fine-real-time-ml-paradigm-hznm5nxif","summary":"Etsy engineers built a system for stateful machine learning (ML) model training and online machine learning. The ML pipelines we use to generate training data from user actions require a number of offline, scheduled batch jobs. The real-time training data team began by looking far upstream of the batch jobs that compute training data.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/bed4189e1d2c210bcc052ac85797141c?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-09-05T19:55:41.000Z"},{"id":"GruQ20VLw","title":"Leveraging Real-Time User Actions to Personalize Etsy Ads","url":"https://www.etsy.com/codeascraft/leveraging-real-time-user-actions-to-personalize-etsy-ads?utm_source=OpenGraph&utm_medium=PageTools&utm_campaign=Share","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/leveraging-real-time-user-actions-to-personalize-etsy-ads-gruq20vlw","summary":"Etsy has introduced a novel, general approach to personalizing ML models based on encoding and learning from short-term (one-hour) sequences of user actions through a reusable three- component deep learning module, the adSformer Diversifiable Personalization Module (ADPM) We describe in detail our method in our recent paper.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/5e65deda880eb1acc67ba0e53be1d4b2?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-07-14T19:54:41.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["openai","okta","c0de517e","sectionio","jamiebrandon"],"opposite_handles":["dailydevworld","on_leuwcq","horde","watercooler","dotnetsquad"],"similar":[{"id":"openai","handle":"openai","name":"OpenAI","is_squad":false,"x":2.1045,"y":-1.3282,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":108,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/984b3632316f4afaa3d5213d5c64fe65","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":0.839684,"median_upvotes":0.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"hype_score":0.0,"avg_read_time":3.679245,"tag_diversity":0.490741},"top_tags_preview":[["openai",43],["ai",32],["chatgpt",19]],"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[1.8824,1.1029],"cadence_depth":[0.3235,-5.3676],"hype_variety":[-6.0735,-0.2059],"title_style":[-6.0735,-3.7647]}},{"id":"okta","handle":"okta","name":"Okta Dev","is_squad":false,"x":2.2192,"y":-1.0487,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":255,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/17da1ccc02574ef9838f856af0e10def","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":0.917568,"median_upvotes":0.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"hype_score":0.009804,"avg_read_time":9.251969,"tag_diversity":0.564706},"top_tags_preview":[["okta",169],["authentication",71],["general-programming",44]],"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[-2.6176,0.4412],"cadence_depth":[4.1471,5.7353],"hype_variety":[1.25,6.1912],"title_style":[-1.3529,0.7794]}},{"id":"c0de517e","handle":"c0de517e","name":"c0de517e's weblore","is_squad":false,"x":2.5207,"y":-1.6194,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":34,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/fb63139f075c449294668657ff772345","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":0.306974,"median_upvotes":0.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"hype_score":0.0,"avg_read_time